{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21361","headline":"酬许五康佐 · 元稹","name":"酬许五康佐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奋迅君何晚，羁离我讵俦。\n鹤笼闲警露，鹰缚闷牵韝。\n蓬阁深沈省，荆门远慢州。\n课书同吏职，旅宦各乡愁。\n白日伤心过，沧江满眼流。\n嘶风悲代马，喘月伴吴牛。\n枯涸方穷辙，生涯不系舟。\n猿啼三峡雨，蝉报两京秋。\n珠玉慙新赠，芝兰忝旧游。\n他年问狂客，须向老农求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}